{"4005220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deep Blue Sushi", "steam_appid": 4005220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4813980], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">DIVE. CATCH. COOK. SERVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/5e48ebb31036e19f70723f1e263ff94f.poster.avif?t=1787230854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/5e48ebb31036e19f70723f1e263ff94f.webm?t=1787230854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/5e48ebb31036e19f70723f1e263ff94f.mp4?t=1787230854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and run a sushi restaurant with your friends but don’t expect everyone to stay in the kitchen. Dive into the depths, hunt for fresh seafood, prepare every order, and work together through each chaotic service.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">MAKE YOUR CHARACTER YOUR OWN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/f2e467db52368d08db41b38dae42f86b.poster.avif?t=1787230854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/f2e467db52368d08db41b38dae42f86b.webm?t=1787230854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/f2e467db52368d08db41b38dae42f86b.mp4?t=1787230854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your look and stand out from the crew. Customize your outfit, colors, hairstyle, and accessories to create a chef that truly feels like yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SLICE IT. ROLL IT. SERVE IT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/d13ce7cf731ddcd50e3037e52b6222d5.poster.avif?t=1787230854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/d13ce7cf731ddcd50e3037e52b6222d5.webm?t=1787230854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/d13ce7cf731ddcd50e3037e52b6222d5.mp4?t=1787230854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare sushi step by step. Add the ingredients, follow each recipe, and turn your fresh catch into handcrafted exotic sushi. From precise cuts to finished rolls, every plate is made by your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">THE DEEP BITES BACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/188ae7155d39440e53822871569caf4c.poster.avif?t=1787230854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/188ae7155d39440e53822871569caf4c.webm?t=1787230854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/188ae7155d39440e53822871569caf4c.mp4?t=1787230854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every catch comes easy. Dive with your crew, track dangerous sea creatures, and fight sharks, piranhas, squid, electric fish, and octopuses to bring home your next big catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">BRING THE RIGHT TOOL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/f95b8463e2dbb7590a0c281b3d732573.poster.avif?t=1787230854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/f95b8463e2dbb7590a0c281b3d732573.webm?t=1787230854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/f95b8463e2dbb7590a0c281b3d732573.mp4?t=1787230854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use specialized tools above and below the surface. Catch fish, explore the ocean, clean up disasters, and choose the right equipment before diving into deeper waters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">EXPLORE THE OCEAN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/2735c0dc8771d1bfa17d2cb1a4228e59.poster.avif?t=1787230854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/2735c0dc8771d1bfa17d2cb1a4228e59.webm?t=1787230854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005220/extras/2735c0dc8771d1bfa17d2cb1a4228e59.mp4?t=1787230854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ocean